</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>I stand upon the mount of God,</l><l>With sunlight in my soul;</l><l>I see the storms in vales beneath,</l><l>I hear the thunder’s roll.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>But I am calm with Thee, my God,</l><l>Beneath these glorious skies;</l><l>And to the height on which I stand</l><l>Nor storms nor clouds can rise.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
